-di-sini","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"permanent-note-lokal-llm":{"type":"header","text":"Permanent note lokal LLM","value":"permanent-note-lokal-llm","line":25,"column":0,"depth":2},"catatan-terkait-di-vault":{"type":"header","text":"Catatan terkait di vault","value":"catatan-terkait-di-vault","line":37,"column":0,"depth":2},"moc-terkait":{"type":"header","text":"MOC terkait","value":"moc-terkait","line":43,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"6ie1ckeu7jfftzq54vt9e44","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"moc-local-llm-dan-copilot-agent\">MOC Local LLM dan Copilot agent<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#moc-local-llm-dan-copilot-agent\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"apa-yang-terkandung-di-sini\">Apa yang terkandung di sini<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#apa-yang-terkandung-di-sini\"></a></h2>\n<p>Catatan ini mengumpulkan insight praktis tentang local LLM untuk coding agent, termasuk:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>problem ekonomi billing Copilot yang sekarang berbasis token,</li>\n<li>perbedaan antara model murah dan total cost-per-task,</li>\n<li>kinerja lokal di Mac M1 dan pentingnya menghindari swap,</li>\n<li>hardware upgrade 4090/3090 sebagai total ownership decision,</li>\n<li>peran agent harness dan workflow yang benar.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"permanent-note-lokal-llm\">Permanent note lokal LLM<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#permanent-note-lokal-llm\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505180207\">Copilot agent overhead sering jadi penyebab latency, bukan kualitas model lokal</a> — Copilot agent overhead sering jadi penyebab latency, bukan kualitas model lokal</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505180208\">Mac M1 16GB realistis untuk local coding agent, tapi 30B bukan daily driver</a> — Mac M1 16GB realistis untuk local coding agent, tapi 30B bukan daily driver</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505180209\">Copilot billing berubah dari message budget ke compute/token budget</a> — Copilot billing berubah dari message budget ke compute/token budget</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505180210\">Total ownership cost local LLM mencakup listrik, PSU, casing, dan maintenance</a> — Total ownership cost local LLM mencakup listrik, PSU, casing, dan maintenance</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505180211\">API pricing ditentukan oleh active parameter dan optimisasi provider, bukan usia model</a> — API pricing ditentukan oleh active parameter dan optimisasi provider, bukan usia model</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505180212\">Efektivitas coding agent lebih tergantung workflow dan state management daripada ukuran model</a> — Efektivitas coding agent lebih tergantung workflow dan state management daripada ukuran model</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505180229\">Swap adalah pembunuh kinerja utama untuk LLM lokal di Mac M1 16GB</a> — Swap adalah pembunuh kinerja utama untuk LLM lokal di Mac M1 16GB</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505180230\">Hitung biaya coding agent berdasarkan total task cost, bukan hanya harga per token</a> — Hitung biaya coding agent berdasarkan total task cost, bukan hanya harga per token</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505180231\">Cloud GPU rental sering lebih rasional daripada beli 4090 untuk penggunaan eksperimental</a> — Cloud GPU rental sering lebih rasional daripada beli 4090 untuk penggunaan eksperimental</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"catatan-terkait-di-vault\">Catatan terkait di vault<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#catatan-terkait-di-vault\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.copilot.raptor-mini-sml-budgeting\">Raptor mini, SML, dan billing Copilot yang pindah ke token</a> — local SML, billing Copilot, dan agent coding konteks</li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">notes.copilot.local-llm-hardware-upgrade (Private)</a> — detail hardware upgrade dan total ownership cost untuk local LLM</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.copilot.token-cheap-coding-agent-providers\">Token murah untuk coding agent</a> — provider-token murah untuk agent coding</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"moc-terkait\">MOC terkait<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#moc-terkait\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.ai-native\">MOC AI-native engineering</a> — MOC AI-native engineering</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.software-architecture\">MOC: Software Architecture</a> — entry point arsitektur yang lebih luas</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #edc8ff;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.moc\">moc</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">local-llm (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">copilot (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai-native (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"n